; The standalone HANDLER runtime — a Fur concept (presentation: view + SSR + the cross-stage seed).
; ISOMORPHIC (Fur + Codec + Bson_json, all jsoo-safe), so a handler's view links into both the server
; SSR and the handler's OWN jsoo bundle. The Conn-aware [serve] + the client [boot] are generated by
; the fur ppx (-handler) from a handler file's payload/load/view; the client boot is Fur_csr.start_page.

(library
 (name fennec_fur_handler)
 (public_name fennec.fur.handler)
 (modes byte native)
 (libraries fennec.fur fennec.pulse.codec fennec-mongo.bson_json)
 (inline_tests
  (backend fennec-hunt.runner))
 (preprocess
  (pps fennec-hunt.ppx)))
